---@class posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiMetric
---@field breakdownAttributionType? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiBreakdownAttributionType|string|distilled.Null For funnel metrics with breakdowns: which step the breakdown value is read from. 'all_events' is not supported for experiment funnels.
---@field breakdownAttributionValue? number|distilled.Null When breakdownAttributionType is 'step', the 0-indexed step to attribute from.
---@field breakdownFilter? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiBreakdownFilter|distilled.Null Break the metric results down by up to 3 event, person, session or group properties.
---@field completion_event? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiEventSource|distilled.Null For retention metrics: completion event.
---@field conversion_window? number|distilled.Null Only count metric events within this many units after the user's first exposure. Requires conversion_window_unit: a window without a unit is ignored and the metric counts events until the experiment ends. Omit both to count until the experiment ends.
---@field conversion_window_unit? posthog.experiments.FunnelConversionWindowTimeUnit|string|distilled.Null Unit for conversion_window: 'second', 'minute', 'hour', 'day', 'week' or 'month'. Required when conversion_window is set.
---@field denominator? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiEventSource|distilled.Null For ratio metrics: denominator source.
---@field denominator_outlier_handling? posthog.experiments.ExperimentMetricOutlierHandling|distilled.Null For ratio metrics: winsorization applied to the denominator aggregate. Leave unset for a binomial-style denominator, which is never clamped.
---@field funnel_order_type? posthog.experiments.StepOrderValue|string|distilled.Null For funnel metrics: how the steps must occur. 'ordered' (default) or 'unordered'. Do not use 'strict': experiment funnels give wrong counts with it.
---@field goal? posthog.experiments.ExperimentMetricGoal|string|distilled.Null Whether higher or lower values indicate success.
---@field ignore_zeros? boolean|distilled.Null For mean metrics: exclude zero values when computing the winsorization percentile thresholds.
---@field kind? string
---@field lower_bound_percentile? number|distilled.Null For mean metrics: winsorization lower percentile bound, as a fraction in [0, 1] (e.g. 0.01 for the 1st percentile). Per-user values below this percentile are clamped to it before aggregation.
---@field metric_type? posthog.experiments.ExperimentMetricType|string
---@field name? string|distilled.Null Human-readable metric name.
---@field numerator? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiEventSource|distilled.Null For ratio metrics: numerator source.
---@field numerator_outlier_handling? posthog.experiments.ExperimentMetricOutlierHandling|distilled.Null For ratio metrics: winsorization applied to the numerator aggregate, independently of the denominator and each with its own percentile thresholds.
---@field retention_window_end? number|distilled.Null
---@field retention_window_start? number|distilled.Null
---@field retention_window_unit? posthog.experiments.FunnelConversionWindowTimeUnit|string|distilled.Null
---@field series? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiMetricSeriesList|distilled.Null For funnel metrics: array of EventsNode/ActionsNode steps.
---@field source? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiEventSource|distilled.Null For mean metrics: event source.
---@field start_event? posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiRetentionStart|distilled.Null For retention metrics: start event. Pass {"kind": "ExperimentExposureNode"} to start retention from the experiment's exposure event; a conversion window or 'last_seen' start_handling is rejected then, because the start is always the user's first exposure.
---@field start_handling? posthog.experiments.StartHandling|string|distilled.Null
---@field threshold? number|distilled.Null For mean metrics: when set, reports the percentage of users whose per-user summed/counted value reaches or exceeds this threshold. Only meaningful for sum/count math types.
---@field upper_bound_percentile? number|distilled.Null For mean metrics: winsorization upper percentile bound, as a fraction in [0, 1] (e.g. 0.99 for the 99th percentile). Per-user values above this percentile are clamped to it before aggregation.
---@field uuid? string|distilled.Null Unique identifier. Auto-generated if omitted.

---@alias posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiMetricSeriesList posthog.experiments.ExperimentApiEventSource[]

